# Solaris — the window's words in Vietnamese (R-ACCESS-2; docs/discussion.md Round 21).
# English is the key; a line per string: "English" = "Tiếng Việt";  — a context: "ctx|English"; a plural: its two
# English keys side by side and ONE form (@plural other: one form for every count). Keep each {1} … {9}.
# Only the window's own words: never a command, an event, the model, the service's lines or the registry's words.
# The UI test `test_the_table_has_every_word_the_window_says` keeps this file equal to the code's keys.
# The words: Tệp (File), Bộ trộn (mixer), kênh (strip), đoạn (clip), làn (lane), kết xuất (render), xuất (export),
# căn nhịp (quantize), vạch thời gian (the time bar).
@language vi
@name Tiếng Việt
@plural other

